From: avalon@coombs.anu.edu.au (Darren Reed)
Subject: IDENT patch for 2.7.2g
To: operlist@eff.org (Operator Mailing List)
Date: Fri, 19 Feb 93 15:06:31 EST

There have been numerous people having problems with server's hanging due
to problems with the ident operations.  To fix the problem of the server
hanging unexpectadly, apply the following bug.

All servers which compile with #define IDENT should apply the patch
below to ircd/authuser.c.

avalon


